id="mwBb8">"Lakers' title celebration on hold after coming up short in LeBron-Butler duel"</a></span>. <i id="mwBcA">The Athletic</i><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwBcE">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwBcI">October 10,</span> 2020</span>. <q id="mwBcM">The rebound off the front of the rim bounced right to Markieff Morris, who pump-faked and, in a moment of apparent panic, threw the ball out of bounds ... His effort to sneak the ball to Davis under the basket yielded nothing other than the Lakers' 15th turnover with just 2.2 seconds to play.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Athletic&amp;rft.atitle=Lakers%27+title+celebration+on+hold+after+coming+up+short+in+LeBron-Butler+duel&amp;rft.date=2020-10-10&amp;rft.aulast=Oram&amp;rft.aufirst=Bill&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2Fathletic%2F2129088%2F2020%2F10%2F10%2Fnba-finals-lakers-title-celebration-on-hold-after-coming-up-short-in-lebron-james-jimmy-butler-duel%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2020+NBA+Finals" class="Z3988" about="#mwt182" id="mwBcQ"></span></span></li>
